1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,505
As a trunk ages, the oldest wood at the centre stops conducting.

2
00:00:04,505 --> 00:00:11,106
Its parenchyma dies, and tannins, resins, gums and oils are deposited in its cells.

3
00:00:11,106 --> 00:00:12,395
It turns dark.

4
00:00:12,395 --> 00:00:20,963
This is heartwood, or duramen: hard, durable, resistant to insects and decay, and purely mechanical.

